					<div class="col">
						<h3 class="section-heading"> Bhoomi Airavat, Borivali West — Now Accepting Bookings</h3><p>Presenting Bhoomi Airavat, an iconic 38-storey residential landmark rising in the heart of Borivali West. With just 198 exclusive residences and only 6 homes per floor, it delivers a rare, low-density living experience defined by privacy, space and lifetime open views.
<br> <br>
Every home is a 3 or 4 BHK deck residence with a private deck, an 11 ft floor-to-ceiling height and a grand double-height entrance lobby. Choose from spacious 3 & 4 BHK homes, or exclusive Jodi, Duplex, Triplex and Penthouse configurations crafted for those who aspire to live above the ordinary.

Strategically located at Sai Baba Nagar near the Gurudwara, close to Kora Kendra and the upcoming Shimpoli Metro, Bhoomi Airavat offers seamless connectivity via Link Road, S.V. Road and the Western Express Highway, with Borivali and Kandivali stations close at hand.

Backed by Bhoomi Developers — 33+ years of experience, 50 delivered projects and 15,000+ happy families — Bhoomi Airavat is more than a home; it is a statement address in one of Borivali West's most prestigious neighbourhoods.</p>
						
