						<!--  About Bhoomi Group - S -->
			<section id="about-bhoomi-group">
				<div class="row">
					<div class="col">
						<p class="fw-bold w-100 mb-2" style="color: var(--clr-p); transform: scale(1.15) translateX(6.5%);">
															About Bhoomi Group
													</p>
						<p>
                            With over three decades of excellence, Bhoomi Developers (Bhoomi Group) has established itself as one of Mumbai’s most trusted real estate brands. Backed by 33+ years of experience, the group has successfully delivered 50 projects, developed over 1 crore sq.ft and handed over homes to 15,000+ happy families.

According to the RERA Act 2016 of the Government of India, all projects of Bhoomi Group, including Bhoomi Airavat, are listed on the Maharashtra Government’s RERA website under registered projects (RERA No. PM1180002600498).
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            <small>
