			<section id="faq" class="light">
				<div class="row">
					<div class="col">
						<h3 class="section-heading text-center w-100">Bhoomi Airavat — Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
						<p class="text-center w-100 mb-3">Everything you need to know about Bhoomi Airavat, Borivali West.</p>

						<div class="accordion faq-accordion" id="faqAccordion">

							<div class="accordion-item">
								<h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqH1">
									<button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqC1" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faqC1">Where is Bhoomi Airavat located?</button>
								</h2>
								<div id="faqC1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="faqH1" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
									<div class="accordion-body">Bhoomi Airavat is located at Sai Baba Nagar, near the Gurudwara, in Borivali West, Mumbai 400092 — close to Kora Kendra Ground and the upcoming Shimpoli Metro station, with easy access to Link Road, S.V. Road and the Western Express Highway.</div>
