									<div class="accordion-body">Bhoomi Airavat offers 3 BHK (1184 sq.ft carpet) and 4 BHK (1556 sq.ft carpet) deck residences, along with exclusive Jodi, Duplex, Triplex and Penthouse homes, plus commercial shops (188–842 sq.ft) on the first floor.</div>
