									<div class="accordion-body">3 BHK deck residences start from ₹5.33 Cr* all-inclusive and 4 BHK deck residences from ₹7.02 Cr* all-inclusive. Jodi, Duplex and Penthouse homes are available on request. Prices are indicative and subject to change.</div>
								</div>
